Dear all,

This is a small thing, but perhaps it had to be done: I have now translated all the code from my little blue bugs book (Kéry, 2010) into JAGS, see the webpage:

https://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/kerybook/

Or directly here:  https://www.mbr-pwrc.usgs.gov/pubanalysis/kerybook/Code_Kery2010_with_JAGS.R

Not surprisingly, hardly any changes were necessary to the BUGS-language models, main changes are due to use of jagsUI as opposed to R2WinBUGS for the printed book.

Thanks to Jim Hines for adapting the web-page !

Best regards  -- Marc

